      <data key="d1">theorem</data>
      <data key="d2">Theorem 3.1</data>
      <data key="d3">Theorem 3.1 follows from Lemma 2.1. Every loopless planar graph is 5-colorable.</data>
      <data key="d4">Chromatic Polynomials and Planar Graph Colorability</data>
