      <data key="d1">definition</data>
      <data key="d2">Definition 1.6.</data>
      <data key="d3">A function u in L^2(Omega) has weak derivative v = d^alpha u if integral u D^alpha phi = (-1)^{|alpha|} integral v phi for all smooth test functions phi.</data>
